    LLM: 'Deal and bet according to the selected lowball variant, then compare hands using the agreed low ranking. Ace-to-five generally ignores straights and flushes for low hands, while deuce-to-seven treats them as bad and makes 7-5-4-3-2 the best low.',
    Player: 'Deal and bet according to the selected lowball variant, then compare hands using the agreed low ranking. Ace-to-five generally ignores straights and flushes for low hands, while deuce-to-seven treats them as bad and makes 7-5-4-3-2 the best low.',
